“By adding this new service line, and bringing someone with Karl’s expertise to the firm, we can service yet another important aspect of our clients’ and prospects’ businesses, ensuring their continued success,” CEO Louis[ Grass]i said in a written statement.
Services will include full security programs, compliance, third party vendor risk assessment, threat management, and managed security services.[]

